  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package refrigerated cheese tortellini",
    "1 (6.5 ounce) jar marinated artichoke hearts, drained and chopped",
    "6 ounces mozzarella cheese, diced",
    "4 ounces sliced pepperoni, quartered",
    "1 (2.25 ounce) can sliced black olives",
    "2 green onions, sliced",
    "0.33333334326744 cup extra-virgin olive oil",
    "1.5 tablespoons balsamic vinegar",
    "1.5 tablespoons distilled white vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon dried Italian herb seasoning",
    "salt and black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/akd1PndUEa_IGxFCYdvZEc-NOVs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206441-tortellini-salad-VAT-005-step-01-6af7d843aa3c45539883a72fd29dd744.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206441/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start the salad: Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil; stir in tortellini and return to a boil. Cook uncovered, stirring occasionally, until the tortellini float to the top and the filling is hot, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Er5zQeP6-LqaRzk0cZQMFSOOLCI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206441-tortellini-salad-VAT-006-step-02-96b12bc4c62b4a9a986fc8a7721af3ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206441/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the tortellini is cooking, make the dressing: Whisk oil, both vinegars, Italian seasoning, salt, and pepper together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HzV-JRMOoUkEVfSCy552pt-3DnQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206441-tortellini-salad-VAT-007-step-03-b9c7d62d28a04caf80aa88d9a2c83382.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206441/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish the salad: Drain tortellini, then rinse with cold water and drain again. Transfer to a large bowl and add artichoke hearts, mozzarella, pepperoni, olives, and green onions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G3jn0xgucjAiFwma1rnXVDtfQ7c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206441-tortellini-salad-VAT-008-step-04-40bc28066f674e67ad3ec04a17b8aff4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206441/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour dressing over top and toss until well combined. Cover and refrigerate for at least 1 hour before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZwqXDgCC6N7KqhAVaEu2vQnwOlk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/206441-tortellini-salad-VAT-009-step-05-4d741681a6bf47c7b98230d5f1c57c77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/206441/step_05.webp"
    }
